@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5289

### Register
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Abc@12345",
  "confirmPassword": "Abc@12345"
}

###

### Login
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Abc@12345"
}

###

### Current user (requires auth cookie)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Accept: application/json

###

### Logout
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/logout
